: convert-noop-compute-shader
:
: Convert the same no-op SPIR-V compute shader used by libmoltenvk's own
: smoke test (../../libmoltenvk/tests/basics/driver.cpp) to MSL, exercising
: convertSPIRV(), which invokes the real Metal compiler at runtime to
: validate the output. Requires real Metal-capable hardware.
:
: The binary fixture ($spv) is generated at build time from noop.spv.hex via
: the xxd build-time dependency (see ../manifest and the ad hoc recipe in
: buildfile). Testscript only consumes the generated file.
:
$* -q -si $spv -mo out.metal &out.metal 2>!;
sed -n -e 's/.*(kernel void).*/\1/p' out.metal >>EOO
kernel void
EOO
